today we're going to talk about

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:09.385
strategies on how to
improve your productivity.

00:00:09.385 --> 00:00:11.053
Rule number three is my personal favorite,

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:12.629
and make sure to stick
around all the way to the end

00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:15.400
for my take, and some
